node_modules/
out/
*.vsix
# playwright run artifacts (traces, error contexts) -- not baselines
test-results/
playwright-report/
# raw per-run perf harness output (tests/perf/run-perf.mjs) -- the point is
# the trend, not any one run's exact numbers; tests/perf/baseline.md is the
# single committed snapshot.
tests/perf/results/
# The shipped install artifact is embedded into the `dl` binary via
# include_bytes! (setup.rs) at a FIXED filename (no version), so it must be
# tracked despite the *.vsix ignore. scripts/build-vsix.sh rebuilds it at the
# crate version; build.rs refuses to compile if the two drift.
!dl-lsp.vsix
